      "description": "Phrasal Verbs GO - Learn 250 Phrasal Verbs through meaning and context\n\nWant to sound natural in English? Confused when native speakers use phrases like \"Get in,\" \"Get off\", or \"Get Over\"?\n\nPhrasal Verbs GO is designed specifically for English language students who want to master real-world vocabulary, pass exams (IELTS, TOEFL, Cambridge), and speak fluent, natural English without endless, boring lists!\n\nCreated by Papa Teach Me—the world-renowned English learning platform with over 1.7 Million subscribers—Phrasal Verbs GO replaces rote memorization with contextual learning, custom illustrations, and interactive brain-training games.\n\nLEARN IN FULL CONTEXT\nStop memorizing isolated word lists! Every phrasal verb comes with a clear definition, realistic example sentences, native audio pronunciation, and custom cartoons that visual learners love. Seeing how verbs function in real conversation makes them stick 10x faster.\n\n3 FUN BRAIN-TRAINING MINI-GAMES\nReinforce your memory while playing! Test your recall, speed, and comprehension through interactive gameplay designed to build automatic recognition:\n• Match the Meaning: Link phrasal verbs to their correct definitions.\n• Sentence Builder: Master correct prepositions and particle placement in real sentences.\n• Speed Recall: Train your brain to understand meanings under timed pressure.\n\nSMART PROGRESS & \"LEARNED\" TRACKER\nFocus only on what you need to study. Mark mastered phrasal verbs as \"Learned\" so they automatically step aside in your daily games, allowing new, challenging vocabulary to enter your practice rotation.\n\nEXTENSIVE & GROWING ILLUSTRATED LIBRARY\nExplore an ever-expanding dictionary of essential phrasal verbs organized by real-life topics: Business, Daily Routines, Travel, Socializing, Health, and Academic Preparation. New illustrations and content updates are added regularly!\n\nDESIGNED FOR ALL ESL LEARNERS\n\nWhether you are:\n• Preparing for IELTS, TOEFL, or CEFR (B1, B2, C1) examinations\n• An intermediate speaker wanting to understand native English fast\n• A professional seeking confident business communication\n• A fan of the Papa Teach Me learning method\n\nPhrasal Verbs GO provides an intuitive, distraction-free environment without ads or hidden subscription fees. Pay once and own your ultimate phrasal verb learning toolkit!\n\nDownload Phrasal Verbs GO today. Train your brain, boost your vocabulary, and start speaking English the Papa Teach Me way!",
